course: dictionary
lesson: 2627
title: Designer: the person who plans
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A designer is a person whose job is to plan how things will look or work. To find the meaning, read the clues around the word. «Big games are made by teams: programmers, artists, designers, writers, sound and music people, testers, producers and more.» The list shows that designers are one kind of worker in a team, next to artists and writers.
explain: Designers plan many different things, such as clothes, buildings, games and websites. A «game designer» plans how a game works, and a «fashion designer» plans how clothes will look. The word before or after designer often tells you what they plan.
explain: Designer can also describe a thing. «Designer clothes» or a «designer brand» are made by a famous company and usually cost a lot. To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence and ask: does it still make sense?
fact: Designer is a noun: one designer, many designers.
fact: A designer plans how things will look or work.
fact: «Designer» can also be an adjective, as in «designer clothes», which are made by a famous fashion company.
fact: «Chief designer» means the head designer, the person in charge of the whole design.
fact: Most big games are made by teams, but some small games are made by one person or a handful of people.
exercise: «Big games are made by teams: programmers, artists, designers, writers, sound and music people, testers, producers and more.» In this sentence, what is a designer? | A game that costs a lot | A computer that runs games | A person who sells games in a shop | *A person who plans how a game will look or work
exercise: Maddie asks, «What does designer mean in designer clothes?» | Made by hand in a bedroom with no plan | *Made by a famous fashion company, and often costly | Free to take home | Very old and worn
exercise: Which job in a game team plans how things look or work? | producers | writers | testers | *designers
test: «Serhii Korolev, chief designer of the Soviet space programme, was born in Zhytomyr.» What does chief designer mean? | *The head designer in charge | A teacher of maths | A rocket that flies to the moon | A person who only draws pictures
test: Which phrase uses designer as an adjective? | *designer label | designers | game designer | fashion designer
exam: A «game designer» plans how a game works, and designers work in teams with programmers and artists. Which best explains what a game designer does? | Cleans the computers in a school | Only plays games for fun | Sells games in a shop | *Plans how a game looks and works
